1
00:00:00,710 --> 00:00:01,630
我今天要带客户看房
I have to show a house today,

2
00:00:01,630 --> 00:00:03,170
直接在卢克的橄榄球赛上见吧
so see you guys at Luke's football games.

3
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:03,780
我累死了才不去
I'm too tired to go.

4
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:04,900
我明天有期中考试
I have a midterm tomorrow

5
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:07,720
很有可能会挂 我昨晚学习到很晚
which I'll probably fail. And I was up really late studying.

6
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:11,400
是真的呢 我昨晚就这样吃惊到很晚
She was. I was up really late doing this.

7
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,330
没必要费劲跑一趟了 我今天不想参加
Don't even bother coming. I'm quitting today.

8
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:16,860
我受够了队里一个家伙总是取笑我
I'm sick of this guy in the team always making fun of me.

9
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:17,650
他那是嫉妒
He's just jealous because

10
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:19,340
因为你才是给记分牌上加分的人
you're the one who puts points on the board.

11
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:20,210
为什么呢
Why?

12
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:22,470
-因为你负责记分 -负责记分
- Because you run the scoreboard. - ...run the scoreboard.

13
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:23,940
我也不去了
I'm out, too.

14
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,600
但你的同学们都会去呢
But all your classmates will be there.

15
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:26,800
我们一整周都互不理睬
We ignore each other all week.

16
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,760
周末歇歇也好啊
It's nice to have a little break on the weekends.

17
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:31,480
老天 我从没见过这么多"被拒者"
Geez, I've never seen such a bunch of no-getters.

18
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:32,270
造词成功
Coined it!

19
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:34,230
记住 保持乐观心态
Remember, keep a positive attitude,

20
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:35,700
好事自然会发生
and good things will happen.

21
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:38,190
我每次带客户看房都带着两样东西
Two things I bring to every open house --

22
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:40,530
我的幸运钢笔和微笑
my lucky pen and a smile.

23
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,280
我整个月都没卖出一套房
I haven't sold a house all month.

24
00:00:42,290 --> 00:00:44,460
你们有听到我说"我不干了"吗 没有
Do you see me saying "I'm done"? Never.

25
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:48,390
因为邓菲家字典里没有"完了"这个词
Because there is no "Done" in Dunphy.

26
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:49,700
我们比赛时见
I'll see you guys at the game.

27
00:00:50,230 --> 00:00:52,340
邓菲家字典里也没有"好烦"这个词
Hey, there is no "Umph" in Dunph--

28
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:53,260
拼法不一样
different spelling!

29
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:56,190
小卡
Cam!

30
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:57,800
菲尔 我记得你的特别战术
Yes, Phil, I remember your special play,

31
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:00,120
但我认为在这样一场重要的赛事上
but I think the triple gull-wing is a little tricky

32
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:03,250
用三路包抄的战术太阴险了
to run at such an important sporting match.

33
00:01:03,250 --> 00:01:06,380
小卡在橄榄球赛季总会有一些
Cam has a number of delightful superstitions

34
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:07,450
可爱的迷信行为
during the football season.

35
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:09,570
管用的话就不是迷信行为
Well, they're not superstitions when they work.

36
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:10,960
好像很科学啊
That seems science-y.

37
00:01:11,530 --> 00:01:15,230
好在今天是最后一场"波以" "死爱"
Not sorry that today is the last g-a-m-e.

38
00:01:15,870 --> 00:01:18,560
谢谢 但好教练不需要靠运气
Well, thank you, but good coaches don't need luck.

39
00:01:19,250 --> 00:01:20,240
我们制造运气
We make luck.

40
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:22,090
我们在"体育活动"中见吧
See you at the athletic endeavor.

41
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:23,840
我要给歌洛莉亚打电话
I'm going to call Gloria

42
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,100
看她能不能去接莉莉
and see if she can pick up Lily, too,

43
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:25,970
以防...
you know, just in case...

44
00:01:25,970 --> 00:01:27,330
怎么 你又要犯拖延症
What, you procrastinate again

45
00:01:27,330 --> 00:01:28,610
不跟查理提辞职吗
and not tell Charlie you're quitting?

46
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:29,920
不是的 我会提的
No, no! I'm gonna do it.

47
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:32,350
我只是 一想到我告诉他时
I just -- I'm picturing his face when I tell him,

48
00:01:32,390 --> 00:01:34,360
他失望摇头的表情 就觉得
shaking his head in disappointment.

49
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:35,270
很难开口
It's -- it's hard.

50
00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:37,110
-提就是了 -不行
- Hey, just do it! - No.

51
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:39,710
我不明白这件事你为什么要这样逼疯自己
I don't know why you're making yourself so crazy over this.

52
00:01:39,710 --> 00:01:40,500
你说得对 你说得对
You're right. You're right.

53
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:41,940
我 我可不想发疯
I -- I do not want to be crazy.

54
00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:43,620
比赛时见
I'll see you at the game.

55
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:46,700
歌洛莉亚
Hey, Gloria.

56
00:01:46,850 --> 00:01:48,780
好 米奇 我会去接她
Yes, Mitch, I will pick her up.

57
00:01:48,860 --> 00:01:51,210
太感谢了 好了 再见 莉莉
Thank you so much! All right. Bye, Lily.

58
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,910
祝你和帕特里克发展顺利
Good luck with the whole Patrick situation.

59
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:54,770
爸爸 你这样让我很丢脸
Dad, you're embarrassing me.

60
00:01:55,530 --> 00:01:57,290
欢迎进入你的人生新阶段 亲爱的
Well, welcome to the rest of your life, sweetheart.

61
00:01:57,830 --> 00:02:00,450
莉莉 跟我说说这个帕特里克的事吧
So, Lily, tell me more about this Patrick.

62
00:02:00,690 --> 00:02:03,150
他喜欢荡秋千 坐在国旗旁边
He likes the swings, he sits by the flag,

63
00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:04,860
而且他可以一直数到一百呢
and he can count to 100.

64
00:02:05,020 --> 00:02:06,610
听起来很完美啊
He sounds like the whole package.

65
00:02:06,630 --> 00:02:07,750
那问题出在哪里
Then what is the problem?

66
00:02:07,940 --> 00:02:09,020
他的眼里没有我
He doesn't notice me.

67
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:10,800
那就让他注意你啊
So then make him notice you.

68
00:02:11,170 --> 00:02:12,750
你可不想到九岁那年
You don't want to wake up one morning

69
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:13,830
醒来发现自己还孤身一人
as a lonely 9-year-old,

70
00:02:13,830 --> 00:02:16,150
心中感叹过去的时光一片空白
wondering where all the time went.

71
00:02:17,950 --> 00:02:19,660
老妈 如果你一会儿去超市
Hey, mom. If you're at the store later,

72
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:20,930
能买点冰回来吗
could you pick up some ice?

73
00:02:20,930 --> 00:02:22,230
比赛后我要用
I'm gonna need it for after the game.

74
00:02:22,290 --> 00:02:23,230
真不愧是我的小运动员
My little athlete.

75
00:02:23,260 --> 00:02:25,350
我想试试我卖了自行车换来的冰淇淋机
I want to try out the gelato maker I traded my bike for.

76
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,290
每次我都想太多了
Lures me in every time.

77
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:28,810
好 再见
Oh, okay. Bye.

78
00:02:29,420 --> 00:02:31,110
爸 你可以在下个红绿灯把我放下来
Dad, you can just drop me at the next light.

79
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:31,810
我可以从那走过去
I can walk from there,

80
00:02:31,810 --> 00:02:33,030
正要我需要给菲尔打个电话
and I got to call Phil anyway.

81
00:02:33,090 --> 00:02:34,080
你昨天也这样
You did the same thing yesterday.

82
00:02:34,090 --> 00:02:35,190
为什么啊 你怎么啦
Why? What's going on with you?

83
00:02:35,570 --> 00:02:38,130
-你又开始抽烟了吗 -没有 不是
- You smoking again? - No! No.

84
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:40,210
我只是 我不想让大家注意到
I just -- I don't want to put a spotlight

85
00:02:40,210 --> 00:02:41,760
我是老板的女儿
on the fact that I'm the boss's daughter.

86
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:42,820
这会让人讨厌我
It makes people resent me.

87
00:02:42,830 --> 00:02:43,940
-这里就好 谢谢老爸 -好吧
- This is good. Thanks, dad. - Yeah.

88
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:48,880
-再见 -再见
- Bye. - Bye.

89
00:02:50,410 --> 00:02:51,650
看得出来那让你很苦恼啊
I can see that bothers you.

90
00:02:51,650 --> 00:02:52,710
是啊 自己的孩子
Well, yeah, your own kid,

91
00:02:52,710 --> 00:02:53,940
觉得被看到和你在一起很丢脸
embarrassed to be seen with you,

92
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:54,600
你能理解吗
you know what I mean?

93
00:02:56,400 --> 00:03:01,400
-你一辈子都在... -到这里就好
- You spend your whole life... - Here's fine.

94
00:03:13,590 --> 00:03:16,490
上个月 我在法学院的一位同学邀请我
Last month, a law-school classmate offered me a job

95
00:03:16,490 --> 00:03:17,590
去他的法律援助协会工作
at his legal aid society,

96
00:03:17,590 --> 00:03:19,110
直觉告诉我 我得接受
and I just knew I had to take it.

97
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:21,430
我写了封信解释这个情况
And I explained that in a letter

98
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:23,600
并打算偷偷放在查理的办公桌上
that I was going to sneak onto Charlie's desk.

99
00:03:24,130 --> 00:03:25,520
太好了 是你啊
Oh, good. It's you.

100
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:30,380
你在这里睡的吗
Did you sleep here?

101
00:03:30,380 --> 00:03:33,490
我女朋友把我甩了 通过电邮
My girlfriend dumped me, uh, in an e-mail.

102
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:35,360
连面对面分手都不敢
Couldn't even do it face-to-face.

103
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:37,240
真够懦弱的 是吧
Pretty gutless, huh?

104
00:03:37,740 --> 00:03:39,620
你应该回家 休息一下
Oh, you should go home, get some rest.

105
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:42,080
我不能回去 太艰难了
I can't go back there. It would be too hard.

106
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:43,340
太多回忆吗
Mm, too many memories?

107
00:03:43,350 --> 00:03:44,480
不是 我们之前住在我的船上
No, we were living on my boat.

108
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:45,610
我不知道她把船开哪儿去了
I don't know where she took it.

109
00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:47,410
不发牢骚了 你有什么事
Enough of my whining. What do you need?

110
00:03:47,410 --> 00:03:51,640
我就是 我就过来打个招呼 你好啊
Oh, well, I just -- I just came by to say hi. Hi.

111
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:57,150
然后顺便用很敞亮的方式告诉你
And also, mm, to tell you in a very gut-ful fashion,

112
00:03:57,150 --> 00:03:58,000
面对面地说说
face-to-face,

113
00:03:58,100 --> 00:04:00,160
我一直在考虑的事情
about something that I have been thinking about.

114
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:03,220
但我真的觉得 我今天不得不
But I do think that, um, I am going to have to leave

115
00:04:03,220 --> 00:04:04,730
提早五分钟下班了
about five minutes early today.

116
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:08,600
小卡在给一支高中橄榄球队做教练
Uh, Cam is -- is coaching a high-school football game.

117
00:04:08,910 --> 00:04:10,140
-我要去 -你说啥
- I'm in. - What?

118
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:12,680
我今天肯定是没心情做这些了
Certainly not gonna be able to focus on any of this today.

119
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:15,230
是的 我需要去看看仪仗队
Yeah, I need a shot of marching bands,

120
00:04:15,230 --> 00:04:18,010
修剪一新的草坪和脸颊粉红的少年们
fresh-cut grass, rosy-cheeked kids.

121
00:04:20,110 --> 00:04:21,480
他们还会跑步穿过横幅吗
Do they still run through a banner?

122
00:04:21,510 --> 00:04:23,580
-会的 -我超爱那个 超爱
- They do! - I love that. I love that.

123
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:26,470
所以比赛大概四点开始对吗
OK. So the game's at what, like, 4:00?

124
00:04:26,630 --> 00:04:28,660
我们应该 把那个给我
We should probably -- hey! Give me that.

125
00:04:29,210 --> 00:04:29,980
我
I'm --

126
00:04:29,980 --> 00:04:31,310
这是我的私人号码
This is my private cell.

127
00:04:32,420 --> 00:04:35,200
全世界只有三个人可以打这个号码
Only three people in the whole world use this.

128
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,500
现在是两个人了
Two people.

129
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:41,940
克莱尔 你为什么
Uh, Claire, is, uh -- is there a reason

130
00:04:42,020 --> 00:04:43,290
没在这张货运单上签字
you didn't sign this shipping form?

131
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:45,050
不好意思 我立刻签
Oh, no. Sorry. I'll do it now.

132
00:04:45,060 --> 00:04:46,780
现在签有点晚了
Oh, no. No. Now's a little late.

133
00:04:46,890 --> 00:04:47,970
运输公司早上来过了
See, they came in this morning,

134
00:04:47,970 --> 00:04:50,200
没有经理签字什么也做不了
and they can't do a thing without a manager's signature.

135
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:52,810
所以现在库房里堆了一百块红木板
So now I've got 100 rosewood panels lined up in the warehouse.

136
00:04:52,810 --> 00:04:54,290
以后我希望你能...
On the future, I'd appreciate it --

137
00:04:54,290 --> 00:04:55,760
蒂姆 我觉得你已经说清楚了
Hey, hey, Tim. I think you made your point.

138
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:57,300
只是个无心之过而已
It was an honest mistake, all right?

139
00:04:57,300 --> 00:04:59,800
-爸 -库房不就是用来
- Dad. - I'm just saying that it's what a warehouse is for,

140
00:04:59,930 --> 00:05:00,770
存东西的嘛
to hold things.

141
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:03,520
-没什么大不了的 -当然
- Not the end of the world. - Right. Of course.

142
00:05:04,650 --> 00:05:06,200
-抱歉 -我才需要抱歉
- Sorry. - No, I'm sorry.

143
00:05:06,350 --> 00:05:08,480
这是我的错 蒂姆 回见
It's my fault. Bye, Tim. Bye!

144
00:05:09,050 --> 00:05:09,620
爸
Dad!

145
00:05:09,620 --> 00:05:12,420
这就是我早上在车里说的情况
This is exactly what I was talking about in the car this morning!

146
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:14,610
我希望他们把我当成同事
I want them to see me like a co-worker,

147
00:05:14,660 --> 00:05:16,350
而不是仗着是老板的女儿
not somebody who's getting special treatment

148
00:05:16,350 --> 00:05:17,510
就拥有特权的人
'cause she's the boss' daughter.

149
00:05:17,540 --> 00:05:20,490
你是不是有点过于敏感了
Is it possible you're being a little oversensitive here?

150
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:23,980
我才没有 我这是...不是吧
No, I'm not. I'm being -- wow, here? Really?!

151
00:05:23,980 --> 00:05:25,210
这是你给我的
You know, you gave me this.

152
00:05:25,300 --> 00:05:28,150
-看看你当时多可爱 -行了行了
- Look how adorable you were. - Okay. Okay. Okay.

153
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:30,890
我希望你能认真听进去我说的话
I want you to try really hard to hear what I'm saying.

154
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:33,690
需要帮助的时候我会找你的
When I need your help, I will ask for it.

155
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:39,840
但在那以前 不要多管闲事
And until then, just butt out.

156
00:05:40,410 --> 00:05:41,450
你怎么变成这样了
What happened to you?

157
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:44,530
米勒 你的脚指头看起来有点孤单
Hey, Miller, your toes are looking a little lonely.

158
00:05:44,530 --> 00:05:45,880
你怎么不去拜访一下它们
Why don't you pay them a visit?

159
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,240
教练 为什么要做这么多热身运动
What's with the extra warm-ups, coach?

160
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,650
这帮人一整年都没赢过比赛
These guys haven't won all year.

161
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:49,830
伙计们你们听到了吗
Did you hear that, team?

162
00:05:50,500 --> 00:05:52,110
米勒同学给你们赢得了一个小礼物
Miller just bought you a little present.

163
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,670
我不是抱怨 我只是想知道为什么要
I wasn't complaining. I was just wondering why we have to --

164
00:05:53,670 --> 00:05:54,530
围操场跑一圈
Take a lap!

165
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:59,000
伯特·拉瓦锡 雷德·斯塔格
Burt Levoisier, Red Stagg,

166
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,500
达琪·庞德
Duckie Pond --

167
00:06:01,140 --> 00:06:02,730
都是这所学校的传奇教练
All coaching legends at this high school,

168
00:06:02,740 --> 00:06:04,920
没人能在第一个赛季拿下超过两场胜利
and none have won more than two games their first season.

169
00:06:05,210 --> 00:06:06,930
今天要是赢了就是我的第三场
I win today, that makes three,

170
00:06:06,930 --> 00:06:10,370
我就会变成有史以来最常胜的新生教练
making me the winningest first-year freshman coach ever.

171
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:13,300
卢克 罗本病了
Oh, hey, Luke, Reuben's sick,

172
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:15,360
所以你要当今天的播报员
so I'm gonna need you to be the announcer today.

173
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:17,770
我怎么可能既计分又播报啊
How am I supposed to keep score and announce at the same time?

174
00:06:17,980 --> 00:06:20,890
跟你既是呆瓜又是笨蛋一样 呆笨
Same way you're a spaz and a dork at the same time, spork.

175
00:06:20,890 --> 00:06:23,330
别这个态度 不过保持这种激情
Okay, lose the attitude, but keep that intensity.

176
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,290
不好意思 裁判
Uh, hey, excuse me, ref.

177
00:06:27,290 --> 00:06:29,080
他们怎么都戴着黑袖标
What's with all the black arm bands?

178
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:30,770
他们的教练昨晚去世了
Their coach passed away last night.

179
00:06:31,260 --> 00:06:32,360
他病了有一段时间了
He'd been sick for a while.

180
00:06:32,450 --> 00:06:34,760
真不幸 我们还要继续比赛吗
That's terrible. And we're still playing?

181
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,840
这些孩子很坚强
Well, they're tough kids.

182
00:06:36,130 --> 00:06:37,970
罗杰·奈特为高中橄榄球队贡献了一生
Roger Knight lived for high-school football,

183
00:06:37,970 --> 00:06:39,460
他们今天是为他而战
so they're playing this one in his honor.

184
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:41,330
伙计们 伙计们
Okay, hey, guys! Guys! Guys! Guys!

185
00:06:41,330 --> 00:06:42,800
这是个不幸的消息
Tragic news about coach Knight.

186
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:44,900
但你们还是要专心打比赛
But you know what? We need to focus up.

187
00:06:45,490 --> 00:06:46,910
表达敬意的机会很多
Plenty of time to pay our respects,

188
00:06:46,910 --> 00:06:48,960
但今天下午不是缅怀奈特教练的时候
but there will be no mourning Knight this afternoon.

189
00:06:50,050 --> 00:06:51,740
-你可真高尚 -是的
- Lot of character over there. - Yep.

190
00:06:52,100 --> 00:06:53,870
-那些孩子一整年都没赢过了 -是的
- Those kids haven't won a game all year. - Uh-huh.

191
00:06:54,210 --> 00:06:55,530
现在还要在他的生日打比赛
And now to have to play on his birthday...

192
00:06:55,530 --> 00:06:56,830
行了 等会儿抛硬币的时候见
Okay, see you at the coin toss.

193
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,500
早安[爱尔兰式]
Top of the morning!

194
00:07:01,050 --> 00:07:01,420
搞房地产
Real estate and,

195
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:02,950
以及从较小的程度上来讲 人生
to a lesser extent, life

196
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:04,320
都在于坚持
is all about perseverance.

197
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:06,350
生活总会有不顺
Things go wrong.

198
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:10,270
钥匙丢了 交易失败 钥匙被乱放
Keys get lost, deals fall through, keys get misplaced.

199
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,910
好多都跟钥匙有关
Uh, a lot of it has to do with keys.

200
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:16,010
这种时候你就会发现世上有两种人
But that's when you find out there are two types of people --

201
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:18,890
一种只会盯着锁了的门浪费时间
those who waste time staring at a closed door...

202
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:31,900
而另一种人会找到一扇窗
and those who find a window.

203
00:07:31,900 --> 00:07:33,940
我正面临第一个"无销售月"的危机
I'm looking at my first month ever without a sale.

204
00:07:34,410 --> 00:07:35,520
有些人也许会放弃
Some people might give up.

205
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:38,050
但菲尔·邓菲绝对不会
But those people aren't Phil Dunphy.

206
00:07:39,110 --> 00:07:40,060
不
No!

207
00:07:40,990 --> 00:07:42,170
就像我告诉孩子们的
It's like I tell my kids --

208
00:07:43,870 --> 00:07:46,780
保持乐观的心态一切就会如你所愿
keep a positive attitude and things will fall your way.

209
00:07:50,550 --> 00:07:52,600
就像我最爱的红发歌手唱的
As my favorite redhead once sang,

210
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,730
明天太阳会照常升起
the sun will come out tomorrow.

211
00:08:02,350 --> 00:08:03,970
那个红发歌手自然是米奇尔
That redhead, of course, was Mitchell,

212
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:06,990
他当时在向我介绍勇敢的孤儿安妮
introducing me to the plucky orphan Annie...

213
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:14,930
她用她永不言败的精神
...whose never-say-die attitude pulled this country

214
00:08:14,930 --> 00:08:16,590
把这个国家从大萧条中
out of a little thing called...

215
00:08:17,500 --> 00:08:19,260
解救出来
the great depression.

216
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:35,400
凡是小女孩能做的事 我也能做
And anything a little girl can do, I can try to do, too.

217
00:08:46,700 --> 00:08:48,360
你们好 欢迎回来
Hey, guys! Welcome back!

218
00:08:48,590 --> 00:08:51,230
请随意参观
Drink it in!

219
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:53,690
很不错吧
Pretty great, huh?

220
00:08:53,780 --> 00:08:57,180
真高兴你们能在白天过来看房子
Oh, am I glad you guys could see this during the daytime.

221
00:08:57,180 --> 00:08:59,520
真心觉得白天房子更显好看
I really think it shows better like that.

222
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:00,930
那么
So?

223
00:09:01,230 --> 00:09:03,410
我们就直入主题掏钱给中介费吧
Should we just cut to the chase and pay me my commission?

224
00:09:03,650 --> 00:09:04,990
开玩笑的 中介费不是直接给我的
I'm kidding. You don't pay me directly.

225
00:09:04,990 --> 00:09:07,010
我邓菲的名字里没有"费"这个字
There's no fee in Dun-- Phil.

226
00:09:07,020 --> 00:09:08,590
菲尔 我们有好消息要宣布
Listen, Phil, we've got some great news.

227
00:09:08,590 --> 00:09:10,510
太好了 我的幸运笔呢
I love it! Where's my lucky pen?

228
00:09:10,510 --> 00:09:12,110
我们想当面告诉你
We wanted to tell you this in person.

229
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:14,200
-我们刚从医院过来的 -我怀孕了
- We just came from the doctor. - I'm pregnant!

230
00:09:14,390 --> 00:09:16,560
天啊 恭喜你们
Oh, my god! You guys!

231
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:18,410
但我们打算等孩子出生后
Except we decided to put off buying the house

232
00:09:18,410 --> 00:09:20,390
-再考虑买房子 -当然
- until after the baby's born. - Sure.

233
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:22,470
-六年来我们一直试着要孩子 -当然
- We've been trying for, like, six years. - Sure.

234
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:23,400
曾经有段时间
For a while there,

235
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,040
我们感觉像在被上帝捉弄
it seemed like the universe was against us.

236
00:09:25,050 --> 00:09:25,530
不可能的
That's ridiculous.

237
00:09:25,530 --> 00:09:27,470
上帝怎么会闲到跟一个人对着干
Why would the universe be against one person?

238
00:09:28,780 --> 00:09:30,070
给你贴张士气贴
Here, have a spirit sticker!

239
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,410
大家都有贴哦
Don't be the only student without one.

240
00:09:33,330 --> 00:09:34,750
我才是这学校的好吗
I actually go to this school!

241
00:09:35,570 --> 00:09:37,450
你还真是路人甲啊
Wow, you really are invisible, huh?

242
00:09:37,770 --> 00:09:39,310
这样再好不过了
I could not be more fine with it.

243
00:09:39,380 --> 00:09:40,980
你特别像一部电影里的角色
You're like that guy from that movie

244
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:42,210
他希望自己没来过人世
who wishes he was never born.

245
00:09:42,850 --> 00:09:43,860
《生活多美好》
"It's a Wonderful Life".

246
00:09:44,210 --> 00:09:45,720
你嘴上这么说 可真这么想吗
You say that, but do you mean it?

247
00:09:46,340 --> 00:09:48,480
雷德·斯塔格球场赢来了美好的一天
Beautiful day here at Red Stagg field.

248
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:50,680
开球的是主场作战的44号
Kicking off for the home team is number 44,

249
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:51,960
杰森·米勒
Jason Miller,

250
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:56,180
该球员还是长曲棍球以及足球运动员
who also plays lacrosse, soccer, and all the girl parts

251
00:09:56,190 --> 00:09:57,720
还在和死党们一起出演的《歌舞青春》里
when he and his friends act out

252
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,490
扮演了所有女生角色
"High School Musical".

253
00:09:58,660 --> 00:10:00,880
很可能是他此生看到女生私处的唯一机会
Quite possibly the only girl parts he'll ever see.

254
00:10:03,070 --> 00:10:03,900
海莉
Haley!

255
00:10:04,170 --> 00:10:05,530
你好啊 迪伦
Hey, Dylan!

256
00:10:05,740 --> 00:10:07,100
我都不知道你会过来
I didn't realize you were coming here.

257
00:10:07,310 --> 00:10:08,190
开玩笑呢
Are you kidding?

258
00:10:08,250 --> 00:10:09,610
这地方对我来说像家一样
This place was like a home to me.

259
00:10:09,810 --> 00:10:11,230
就好像我是在家里上学一样
It's like I was homeschooled.

260
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,950
但并不是 我是在学校里上的学
But I wasn't. I was school-schooled.

261
00:10:13,410 --> 00:10:14,250
是么
Were you?

262
00:10:15,030 --> 00:10:17,030
我兜里有六种药
I got six kinds of pills in my pocket,

263
00:10:17,030 --> 00:10:20,580
但来看少年们比赛才是最好的治疗
but this here, all this, this is the best medicine.

264
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,380
我很高兴你感觉好点了
Aw, I'm glad you're feeling better.

265
00:10:23,830 --> 00:10:24,930
是这样的 查理 我
So, Charlie, I --

266
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,780
我是来接莉莉的
I'm here to get Lily.

267
00:10:29,870 --> 00:10:32,340
去叫她前我要跟您说一下今天出的小事故
Oh, before I call her, we had a small issue today.

268
00:10:32,630 --> 00:10:35,020
有个叫帕特里克的男孩说莉莉把他推倒
One of the boys, Patrick, said Lily pushed him down

269
00:10:35,020 --> 00:10:36,460
还要亲他
and tried to kiss him.

270
00:10:36,490 --> 00:10:38,250
不可能 莉莉很高冷的
No, that doesn't sound like Lily.

271
00:10:38,250 --> 00:10:40,500
她可能是在模仿在电视上
She was probably imitating something she saw

272
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:41,850
或家里看到的情景
on TV or in her family --

273
00:10:41,850 --> 00:10:43,340
一定是在电视上看到的
Ay, it was the TV, yes.

274
00:10:43,870 --> 00:10:46,040
她来了 你看她多可爱啊
Oh, but here she is. She's always so sweet.

275
00:10:46,730 --> 00:10:48,230
再见 帕特里克
Bye, Patrick.

276
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:50,300
看到了吗 他们只是好朋友
You see? They're just friends.

277
00:10:50,910 --> 00:10:52,490
你笑个屁啊 埃文
What are you laughing at, Evan?

278
00:10:52,490 --> 00:10:53,650
下一个就是你
You're next.

279
00:10:55,140 --> 00:10:57,220
好吧 我会跟她单独谈谈的
Okay, I'm going to talk to her for a little bit.

280
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:02,360
我跟你说过我把你名字写到那上面吗
Oh, did I ever tell you that I put your name up here?

281
00:11:02,730 --> 00:11:03,590
什么
Huh?

282
00:11:03,830 --> 00:11:05,240
海莉·邓菲的小巨蛋
"Haley Dunphy dome."

283
00:11:05,470 --> 00:11:07,480
真好 你还给我们的专属地点命名了
Aww, you named our special spot?

284
00:11:07,580 --> 00:11:10,100
其实我本来想写"海莉·邓菲摸我蛋"的
Actually it was supposed to be "Haley Dunphy, do me."

285
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:12,040
我不太会控制单词间的距离
I'm bad with spacing.

286
00:11:12,690 --> 00:11:14,580
你没那么糟糕啦
Oh, you're not so bad.

287
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:18,730
中场休息 黑豹队6比0领先海豚队
And that's halftime -- Panthers 6, Dolphins 0.

288
00:11:18,930 --> 00:11:20,710
0分是由杰森·米勒
That zero score by Jason Miller,

289
00:11:20,850 --> 00:11:22,530
骄傲地跑出界造成的
who proudly prances off the field.

290
00:11:23,130 --> 00:11:24,650
别拦我 我要上去踹那小子两脚
Just let me go up there and kick that kid's butt.

291
00:11:24,650 --> 00:11:26,100
行了米勒 你的腿是用来跑的
Knock it off, Miller. I need your leg.

292
00:11:26,110 --> 00:11:26,830
都单腿跪下
Take a knee.

293
00:11:27,710 --> 00:11:29,930
我不知道你们这些小海豚游进了什么陷阱
Now, I don't know what tuna net you Dolphins swam into,

294
00:11:29,940 --> 00:11:31,710
但你们快完蛋了啊
but you are drowning out there!

295
00:11:31,790 --> 00:11:34,240
教练 输了的话有那么糟糕吗
Coach, would it really be such a bad thing if we lost?

296
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:36,340
-你说什么 -你看看他们
- Beg your pardon? - Look at them, coach.

297
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,880
他们还不够惨吗
Haven't they lost enough already?

298
00:11:38,030 --> 00:11:39,270
也许让他们赢一次
Maybe giving them a win would,

299
00:11:39,270 --> 00:11:40,960
在某种程度上也是成全了我们自己
in a way, be a victory for us, too.

300
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,410
你知道什么对于奈特教练最重要吗
Okay, you know what mattered the most to coach Knight?

301
00:11:42,410 --> 00:11:43,750
照顾那些需要特殊关照的孩子们吗
His work with special-needs kids?

302
00:11:43,750 --> 00:11:45,890
他只是有一次带了一个孩子去海边而已
Okay, he took one kid to one beach one time.

303
00:11:46,070 --> 00:11:46,900
是橄榄球
Football!

304
00:11:47,090 --> 00:11:48,280
橄榄球才是最重要的
Football is what mattered the most!

305
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:50,000
他为胜利而活
He lived for competition!

306
00:11:50,210 --> 00:11:53,720
他的信仰是运动员精神 一种气节
He believed in sportsmanship, integrity!

307
00:11:54,220 --> 00:11:56,580
懂吗 我认为 你们大可以上场
Okay? Now, the way I see it, we can roll over

308
00:11:56,820 --> 00:11:59,190
让他们轻松获胜 但那毫无意义
and give them an empty, meaningless victory

309
00:11:59,190 --> 00:12:00,600
他在九泉之下也不会开心的
that he... would hate.

310
00:12:00,940 --> 00:12:03,940
但我们可以自信上场 使出浑身解数
Or we can go out there, leave it all on the field,

311
00:12:04,560 --> 00:12:07,160
让他输也输得心服口服
and be a team he would be proud to lose to.

312
00:12:08,310 --> 00:12:10,470
告诉我 你们是一个人还是一个团队
Now, is this an "I" activity or a "We" activity?!

313
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:11,660
-团队 -听不见
- We! - What?!

314
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:12,490
-团队 -听不见
- We! - What?!

315
00:12:12,490 --> 00:12:14,840
-团队 团队 团队 -这就对了
- We! We! We! We! We! We! - That's right!

316
00:12:14,990 --> 00:12:16,620
你看你们连叫声都像海豚了
Now you sound like dolphins!

317
00:12:18,510 --> 00:12:19,420
你好 蒂姆
Hey, Tim!

318
00:12:19,860 --> 00:12:21,780
接下来三天的发货单给你
I got the next three days of delivery slips

319
00:12:21,780 --> 00:12:23,280
都签好了 不错吧
for you here, signed, huh?

320
00:12:23,490 --> 00:12:24,750
-谢谢你 克莱尔 -没事
- Thanks, Claire. - Yeah.

321
00:12:25,090 --> 00:12:26,090
都签好字了哦
Signed those up good, huh?

322
00:12:27,190 --> 00:12:28,160
多谢
Thanks.

323
00:12:28,330 --> 00:12:31,290
这个 这就是桦木家具啊
So, this is -- this is the, uh, the regency birch?

324
00:12:31,290 --> 00:12:33,080
真不错 好看
Beautiful model. Gorgeous.

325
00:12:33,080 --> 00:12:35,180
你们在下面做的工作很棒
You guys do such good work down here.

326
00:12:35,390 --> 00:12:37,330
我说真的 介意我在它们被送到
Really, you mind if I take her for a spin

327
00:12:37,330 --> 00:12:38,480
展厅之前先参观下吗
before she goes up to the showroom?

328
00:12:38,570 --> 00:12:40,660
-随意 你是老大 -...的闺女
- You're the boss... - 's daughter.

329
00:12:41,070 --> 00:12:42,560
我知道这才是你的心里话
That's what you want to say.

330
00:12:42,810 --> 00:12:46,490
为了运输方便没有装镜子 有道理
Oh, okay. So, no mirror when they're shipping, which makes sense.

331
00:12:48,450 --> 00:12:51,690
而且 也没把手啊
Also have, uh... no handles.

332
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:53,980
蒂姆
Hey -- hey, Tim?

333
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,900
蒂姆
Hey, Tim!

334
00:12:58,760 --> 00:12:59,860
蒂姆
Tim!

335
00:13:01,050 --> 00:13:02,980
我的天 喂 爸
Oh, god. Yeah, hi, dad.

336
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,190
你好 同事
Hey, co-worker.

337
00:13:04,410 --> 00:13:06,130
我就问问你几点出发去看比赛
Just seeing when you want to leave for the game.

338
00:13:06,130 --> 00:13:08,860
-我们已经迟到了 -马上 马上
- We're late already. - Soon, soon.

339
00:13:10,740 --> 00:13:11,890
我 我在 我在收工了
I'm -- I'm just -- I'm finishing up

340
00:13:11,890 --> 00:13:13,230
我办公室里有点儿文书工作
a little paperwork in my office.

341
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:16,000
好吧 需要帮忙的话跟我说一声
Okay. Let me know if you need any help.

342
00:13:16,170 --> 00:13:17,260
不用 我不需要你帮忙
No, I do not need your help.

343
00:13:17,260 --> 00:13:21,140
而且我相信我说过了 我希望你
And as I believe I mentioned, I would appreciate it

344
00:13:21,300 --> 00:13:24,910
不要总是严密监视着我
if you were not constantly looking over my shoulder.

345
00:13:25,010 --> 00:13:25,990
拜托 别把我想得那么差劲
Come on. Give me some credit.

346
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:27,590
我绝对不会那么做的
That's the last thing I would do.

347
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:31,180
爸 你好像忘了我成功养大了三个孩子
Dad, you seem to forget that I raised three children,

348
00:13:31,470 --> 00:13:34,740
而且在那之前我还有份事业
and I had a career before this.

349
00:13:34,930 --> 00:13:37,800
我做了很多不...
I have done plenty of stuff that does not --

350
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:40,790
你听到了吗
Do you hear that?

351
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:42,960
听起来是从库房传来的声音
Sounds like it's coming from the warehouse.

352
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:44,590
是啊 那是什么声音
Yeah, what even is that?

353
00:13:46,560 --> 00:13:47,890
我确定没什么大不了的
Oh, I'm sure it's nothing.

354
00:13:48,590 --> 00:13:51,500
给你个建议 听不听由你
Uh, one piece of advice -- take it or leave it.

355
00:13:52,900 --> 00:13:53,770
什么
What?

356
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:56,550
门闩在嵌板的右下方
The latch is under the panel on the right.

357
00:14:04,420 --> 00:14:06,340
我给你买了你喜欢的芥末泡菜
I got you mustard and sauerkraut, just what you like.

358
00:14:06,970 --> 00:14:08,290
你好得有点儿吓人
You're being awfully nice,

359
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:11,510
我刚才可是掀起了一场衣柜龙卷风
considering I started that whole closet-nado.

360
00:14:11,630 --> 00:14:12,790
你仍然是我闺女
Well, you're still my daughter.

361
00:14:12,790 --> 00:14:14,510
我在这里可以这么叫你吧
It's okay I call you that here, right?

362
00:14:14,510 --> 00:14:15,400
可以
Yeah.

363
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:18,130
听着 我很难像对其他人那样对待你
Listen, it's hard for me to treat you like everyone else.

364
00:14:18,290 --> 00:14:20,570
你是唯一一个被我抱着回家的人
You're the only one I carried home in my arms --

365
00:14:20,770 --> 00:14:23,400
除了去年圣诞派对上的唐雷尔
Except Dontrell, last year's Christmas party.

366
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:25,830
我几乎是把他从汽车天窗里灌进去的
I pretty much poured him through his sunroof.

367
00:14:25,830 --> 00:14:27,470
但我会尽力
But I'll try.

368
00:14:28,150 --> 00:14:28,840
谢谢 爸
Thanks, dad.

369
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,150
你这周末有安排吗
You got plans this weekend?

370
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,320
-还没有 怎么了 -很好
- No. Not really. Why? - Good.

371
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:33,550
明天早上8点到库房
Be at the warehouse, 8:00 tomorrow.

372
00:14:33,550 --> 00:14:34,760
别穿太好的衣服
Wear something you don't care about.

373
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,200
伙计们
Hey, guys.

374
00:14:36,410 --> 00:14:37,020
你好 亲爱的
Hi, honey.

375
00:14:37,020 --> 00:14:38,120
战况如何
What'd I miss?

376
00:14:38,580 --> 00:14:39,290
不太好
Nothing good.

377
00:14:39,290 --> 00:14:41,340
只剩3分钟了 还差6分
We're down by 6 with 3 minutes to play.

378
00:14:41,340 --> 00:14:42,950
他们还是有可能转败为胜的
Well, they could still turn it around.

379
00:14:43,110 --> 00:14:44,880
比赛还没完全结束... 妈呀
Show's not over till the fat -- mama!

380
00:14:45,860 --> 00:14:48,840
米勒震撼人心的凌空一脚
Sensational punt by Miller, who hasn't kicked that high

381
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:50,140
自从他打破性别界限
since he broke the gender barrier

382
00:14:50,140 --> 00:14:52,200
加入现代舞队以来 从没踢过那么高
and joined our own modern dance troupe.

383
00:14:52,230 --> 00:14:53,800
-你还好吧 亲爱的 -还好
- Are you okay, honey? - Yeah!

384
00:14:53,810 --> 00:14:55,940
一切在于保持心观乐态
It's all about keeping an attitive positude.

385
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:58,180
乐心观态
Positude attitive.

386
00:14:59,260 --> 00:15:01,200
我们今晚应该去看夜场电影
Hey, we should see a midnight movie tonight,

387
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,320
像以前那样
like old times.

388
00:15:02,330 --> 00:15:04,040
太棒了 我要去
Oh, my god. I am so in!

389
00:15:04,310 --> 00:15:05,260
好 好极了
Cool. Cool.

390
00:15:05,290 --> 00:15:07,510
我11点半左右带着梯子去你家找你吧
I'll come by your house around 11:30 with the ladder?

391
00:15:07,510 --> 00:15:09,840
我不需要从窗子偷偷爬出去了 迪兰
I don't need to climb out of my window anymore, Dylan.

392
00:15:10,630 --> 00:15:13,750
可以早点儿吗 我明天期中考试
Oh, ooh. Can we do it earlier? I have a midterm tomorrow.

393
00:15:13,860 --> 00:15:15,080
我早不了
Oh, I can't do earlier.

394
00:15:15,150 --> 00:15:17,550
我得和几个护士学校的同学见面
I've got to meet up with some classmates from nursing school.

395
00:15:17,860 --> 00:15:19,040
你要当护士吗
You're gonna be a nurse?

396
00:15:19,260 --> 00:15:21,610
是的 我觉得这是我注定的发展方向
Yeah, I figured it was a natural next step.

397
00:15:21,740 --> 00:15:23,610
我一直在用音乐为人们疗伤
I've always healed people with my music,

398
00:15:23,610 --> 00:15:25,940
现在我不过是要用药物做同样的事情
and now I'm just doing the same thing with drugs.

399
00:15:26,290 --> 00:15:28,540
好吧 那就下次吧
Wow. Well, ye-- another time, then.

400
00:15:28,860 --> 00:15:30,250
-好的 -好的
- Yeah. - Yeah.

401
00:15:32,250 --> 00:15:33,930
如果一切顺利的话
Hey, if everything goes well,

402
00:15:33,930 --> 00:15:35,680
也许有一天我会在医院里见到你
maybe one day I'll see you in the hospital.

403
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,120
我很乐意
I'd like that.

404
00:15:38,390 --> 00:15:39,600
最后我终于从衣柜里出来了
So, I finally get out of the closet,

405
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:41,550
爸就在那里鄙视地看着我
and there's dad looking down at me.

406
00:15:41,870 --> 00:15:42,660
我知道那感觉
Been there.

407
00:15:43,110 --> 00:15:44,030
但是和父亲之间这种微妙的关系
The whole daddy thing, though,

408
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:45,400
一直是你的一大难题
it's really one of your bigger issues.

409
00:15:45,900 --> 00:15:48,000
至少我的问题是和我亲爸之间的
At least my daddy issues are with my actual daddy.

410
00:15:48,210 --> 00:15:50,520
我不会把我认识的每个权威人物
I don't run around making every authority figure

411
00:15:50,520 --> 00:15:51,670
都当爹一样对待
I meet into a father.

412
00:15:51,670 --> 00:15:52,550
等等
Wait.

413
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:53,650
你这是什么意思
W-what's that supposed to mean?

414
00:15:53,850 --> 00:15:55,110
米奇尔 拜托
Mitchell, come on.

415
00:15:55,110 --> 00:15:56,830
你为什么还没跟你老板提辞职
Why have you not quit your job yet?

416
00:15:56,830 --> 00:15:58,090
他女朋友刚把他甩了
His girlfriend just broke up with him.

417
00:15:58,090 --> 00:15:59,400
好吧 那你上个星期的借口是什么
Yeah, and what was your excuse last week?

418
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:00,080
我感冒了
I had a cold.

419
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:00,840
上上个星期呢
And the week before?

420
00:16:00,850 --> 00:16:01,900
我感觉快要感冒了
I felt a cold coming on.

421
00:16:02,290 --> 00:16:06,440
米奇尔 这封信从你外套里掉出来了
Mitchell, this fell out of your jacket.

422
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:08,050
能给个解释吗
Care to explain?

423
00:16:08,060 --> 00:16:10,020
我是替一个朋友存放的
I was holding it for a friend.

424
00:16:12,820 --> 00:16:13,680
你要辞职吗
You want to quit?

425
00:16:14,490 --> 00:16:16,240
查理 你 你是个好老板
Charlie, you're -- you're a great boss,

426
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:17,750
但我接到了另一份工作邀请
but I ju-- I got this other offer,

427
00:16:17,750 --> 00:16:19,550
我真的很想念在法庭上辩论的感觉
and I just really miss the courtroom.

428
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:21,660
我跟你说实话
Well, I'm not gonna lie to you,

429
00:16:21,660 --> 00:16:23,910
你 真的让我很失望
you're... really letting me down.

430
00:16:25,150 --> 00:16:26,730
我对你有更高的期望
I just expected so much more out of you.

431
00:16:26,730 --> 00:16:28,730
你是我的最喜欢的员工
Ohh. You were my favorite.

432
00:16:28,760 --> 00:16:30,330
天啊
Ohh, god.

433
00:16:30,330 --> 00:16:33,550
也许 我可以在周末给你做事
Um, well, maybe I-I could still do things on the weekends.

434
00:16:34,610 --> 00:16:36,540
不 不 查理 我 我很抱歉
No, no! Charlie, I'm -- I'm sorry.

435
00:16:36,630 --> 00:16:38,390
我 我不干了
I -- I'm done.

436
00:16:39,250 --> 00:16:40,020
你知道吗
You know what?

437
00:16:40,930 --> 00:16:41,800
我不怪你
I don't blame you.

438
00:16:42,430 --> 00:16:44,060
我必须得重新脚踏实地[回到陆地上来]
I have to get back on solid ground.

439
00:16:44,810 --> 00:16:46,520
-彼此彼此 -我比你更需要
- We both do. - Well, I do more.

440
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:47,860
我住在船上
My house is a boat.

441
00:16:48,870 --> 00:16:50,090
你害我惹上麻烦了
You made me in trouble.

442
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:52,990
我可没有教你靠扑倒对方来追男孩子
I didn't tell you to sit on a boy until he liked you.

443
00:16:53,010 --> 00:16:54,220
-你就是这么教的 -不是
- Yes-huh. - Nuh-huh.

444
00:16:54,310 --> 00:16:55,620
我不跟你玩了
We're not doing this again.

445
00:16:58,100 --> 00:16:59,410
主队申请暂停
Home team calls time-out.

446
00:16:59,690 --> 00:17:01,660
还剩12秒 落后6分
12 seconds left, they're down by 6,

447
00:17:01,740 --> 00:17:03,590
很难摆脱米勒诅咒了
and unable to shake the Miller curse.

448
00:17:03,720 --> 00:17:04,620
我受够了
That's it!

449
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:07,500
好了 孩子们 最后一搏了
Okay, boys, final play.

450
00:17:07,760 --> 00:17:08,920
让我们使个小诈
Time for a little trickery.

451
00:17:09,490 --> 00:17:11,050
亲爱的 你今天怎么了
Oh, honey. What happened to you today?

452
00:17:11,170 --> 00:17:12,470
上帝给了我一个打击
A cosmic pummeling.

453
00:17:13,430 --> 00:17:14,510
我这笔生意泡汤了
I lost the deal.

454
00:17:14,890 --> 00:17:15,750
如果明天不赶着卖一套
If I don't close on one tomorrow,

455
00:17:15,750 --> 00:17:18,000
这将是我有史以来第一个"无销售月"
it's gonna be my first month ever with no sale.

456
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:20,100
事实上 这个月没有31号
Actually, there is no 31st this month.

457
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:21,420
你说什么
What are you talking about?

458
00:17:21,430 --> 00:17:22,420
明天就是1号了
Tomorrow's the first.

459
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:24,550
亲爱的 抱歉 你还好吗
Honey, I'm sorry. Are you okay?

460
00:17:24,670 --> 00:17:25,450
不 我很不好
No, I'm not okay!

461
00:17:25,450 --> 00:17:27,250
我才发现我已经没有明天了
I just found out there is literally no tomorrow!

462
00:17:28,850 --> 00:17:30,130
我总说 如果坚持等待
You know, I always say if you wait long enough,

463
00:17:30,130 --> 00:17:31,080
幸运之神总会降临
your luck will change?

464
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,710
结果等来的只是一堆垃...
Turns out that's just a big pile of c--

465
00:17:32,710 --> 00:17:34,060
坐稳了 朋友们
Hold on to your hats, folks.

466
00:17:34,810 --> 00:17:38,420
是吗 是的 这就是三路包抄
Are they? They are! It's the triple gull-wing!

467
00:17:38,450 --> 00:17:39,520
这是我排的策略
That's my play!

468
00:17:39,580 --> 00:17:42,030
伍德森假装往右 他又一次假装往右
Woodson fakes right, he fakes right again,

469
00:17:42,210 --> 00:17:44,660
他假装要假装向右 他得分了
he fakes faking right, and he scores!

470
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:46,340
他们用我的策略得分了
They scored on my play!

471
00:17:46,900 --> 00:17:49,140
-米奇尔说你可以卖房给我 -没错
- Mitchell says you can sell me a house. - Yes, I can!

472
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:51,480
-菲尔干得好 这是你排的吗 -是
- Good call, Phil. Was that your play?! - Yes, it was!

473
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:52,900
你表现得太野蛮了 莉莉
You're being too rough, Lily.

474
00:17:52,910 --> 00:17:54,410
你不能看见一个男人
You cannot just see a guy and,

475
00:17:54,410 --> 00:17:56,580
就这么上去亲他 懂吗
mwah, kiss him like that, okay?

476
00:17:56,580 --> 00:17:58,380
你可以 你可以的
Yes, you can! Yes, you can!

477
00:17:58,670 --> 00:18:00,860
米勒出局了 曼尼 你是替补开球手
Okay! Okay! Miller's out. Manny, you're my backup kicker.

478
00:18:00,860 --> 00:18:01,960
我需要你上去拿下这脚球
I need you to go out there and nail this.

479
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:02,530
即使我踢不中
Although if I miss it,

480
00:18:02,530 --> 00:18:04,180
平局何尝不是一个完美的方式...
wouldn't a tie be a perfect way to --

481
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:05,060
曼尼 够了
Manny, enough!

482
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:07,150
你不能夺走我的胜利
You are not gonna take away my victory!

483
00:18:08,370 --> 00:18:10,730
我是说 你们的胜利
I mean -- I mean, your victory.

484
00:18:11,260 --> 00:18:11,910
好吗
Okay?

485
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:14,220
曼尼 抱歉 我不该吼你的
Manny, I'm sorry. I should not have yelled at you.

486
00:18:14,250 --> 00:18:16,310
你尽管过去 做你觉得正确的事
You can go out there and do whatever feels right.

487
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:18,300
好吗 不管怎样我都支持你
Okay? I support you no matter what.

488
00:18:22,990 --> 00:18:26,330
准备 发射
Hut! Hut! Hike!

489
00:18:34,570 --> 00:18:37,030
我赢了 我赢了 我是说我们赢了
I won! I won! I mean, we won!

490
00:18:37,340 --> 00:18:38,420
我们赢了 我们赢了
We won! We won!

491
00:18:39,690 --> 00:18:41,070
抱歉 女士
Ooph! Sorry, ma'am.

492
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,860
女士 英语课我就坐你边上
Ma'am? I sit next to you in English.

493
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,670
我好像把手机落在看台下面了
Hey, I think I dropped my phone under the bleachers.

494
00:18:44,670 --> 00:18:45,420
和我去拿一下好吗
Come get it with me?

495
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:47,860
找到了
Found it.

496
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:50,340
太好了 世界又平静了
Great, and world order is restored.

497
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:52,440
-可以回家了吗 -可以
- Can we go home now? - Yeah. Okay.

498
00:18:52,710 --> 00:18:53,870
看 这是什么
Oh, hey, what's that?

499
00:18:55,550 --> 00:18:57,430
艾丽克斯·邓菲的小巨蛋
"Alex Dunphy dome?"

500
00:18:57,760 --> 00:19:00,370
我觉得是"艾丽克斯·邓菲摸我蛋"
Uh, I think it says "Alex Dunphy, do me."

501
00:19:00,520 --> 00:19:02,390
谁会写这种东西
Ugh, who would write something like that?

502
00:19:02,630 --> 00:19:03,440
不知道
No idea.

503
00:19:04,570 --> 00:19:05,840
需要我帮你擦掉吗
Hey, you want me to scratch it out?

504
00:19:05,970 --> 00:19:08,830
不 我是说 太晚了
No! I mean, pfft, too late now.

505
00:19:09,060 --> 00:19:10,220
已经写在那了 就这样吧
If it's out there, it's out there.

506
00:19:12,190 --> 00:19:12,980
小冠军
Hey, champ.

507
00:19:13,420 --> 00:19:14,960
不去和大家庆祝一下吗
Aren't you gonna go celebrate with your team?

508
00:19:16,010 --> 00:19:17,180
去 等会就去
Yeah, in a minute.

509
00:19:23,510 --> 00:19:25,000
你本来是不打算踢中的 对吗
You meant to miss the kick, didn't you?

510
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:25,750
我搞砸了
I blew it.

511
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:28,470
十次我有九次踢不中
I could miss that kick nine out of ten times.

512
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:30,620
怎么真正需要踢不中的时候却踢中了呢
Why couldn't I miss it when it counted?

513
00:19:32,690 --> 00:19:33,670
让我来问问你
Let me ask you something.

514
00:19:34,550 --> 00:19:36,050
当球穿过球门
That ball sails through the uprights,

515
00:19:36,650 --> 00:19:38,220
队员们举着你走出球场
your team carries you off the field.

516
00:19:39,340 --> 00:19:40,240
那感觉怎样
How does that feel?

517
00:19:42,150 --> 00:19:43,920
-说啊 -感觉很好
- Come on. - Good.

518
00:19:44,140 --> 00:19:46,250
成为团队一员很开心
It's fun being part of a team.

519
00:19:46,430 --> 00:19:48,220
成为大英雄更是开心
And it's really fun being the hero.

520
00:19:48,530 --> 00:19:51,760
所以我觉得 你是特意要踢中的
So I think you made that kick on purpose.

521
00:19:52,390 --> 00:19:53,180
听我说
And listen.

522
00:19:53,830 --> 00:19:55,190
你现在也许还不想承认
I don't think you're willing to admit it yet,

523
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:57,030
但在每个人性深处
but somewhere underneath all that humanity,

524
00:19:57,030 --> 00:19:58,370
都有一个好胜者 抱歉
there's a competitor -- sorry.

525
00:19:58,600 --> 00:20:00,450
都有一个好胜者 曼尼
There's a competitor, and, Manny,

526
00:20:00,460 --> 00:20:02,100
这没什么不对的
there's nothing wrong with that.

527
00:20:02,790 --> 00:20:03,630
没什么不对
Nothing.

528
00:20:05,790 --> 00:20:06,560
谢谢你 教练
Thanks, coach.

529
00:20:07,370 --> 00:20:08,390
想去吃点比萨吗
You want to go eat some pizza?

530
00:20:08,700 --> 00:20:09,600
-当然 -我也要来点
- Sure. - Me, too.

531
00:20:12,210 --> 00:20:14,700
你觉得他们会用你的名字命名这个赛场吗
Hey, you think someday they might name this field after you?

532
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:15,750
你并不是第一个
Well, you're not the first person

533
00:20:15,750 --> 00:20:16,840
这么想的人
to think along those lines.

534
00:20:17,120 --> 00:20:19,090
早些时候 就有人在职工卫生间写上
Earlier today, someone in the faculty bathroom

535
00:20:19,090 --> 00:20:21,300
"卡梅隆·塔克的小巨蛋"这个名字了
was messing around with the phrase "Cameron Tucker dome."

536
00:20:21,930 --> 00:20:23,870
我刚卖出了镇上最贵的房子
Just sold the most expensive house in town,

537
00:20:23,870 --> 00:20:25,750
房都没看 全部现金付清
sight unseen, all cash.

538
00:20:25,780 --> 00:20:27,410
-怎样 -我为你骄傲 老爸
- How 'bout that? - I'm proud of you, dad.

539
00:20:28,330 --> 00:20:30,070
邓菲一家今天都很棒
Pretty great day for all the Dunphys.

540
00:20:30,280 --> 00:20:33,230
然后我说"米歇尔 你真的相信那些
And then I said, "Michelle, do you honestly believe

541
00:20:33,230 --> 00:20:34,740
愚蠢的谣言吗"
every stupid rumor you hear?"

542
00:20:35,710 --> 00:20:36,520
你还没听说吗
Oh, you haven't heard?

543
00:20:36,690 --> 00:20:39,400
很明显 我的某一个前任...
Well, apparently, one of my exes is just, like...

544
00:20:39,420 --> 00:20:41,340
蒂姆 真抱歉你受伤了
Tim, I -- I am so sorry that you got hurt,

545
00:20:41,340 --> 00:20:42,340
我会查出问题所在
and I will get to the bottom of it,

546
00:20:42,340 --> 00:20:44,790
但我怀疑是竞争对手故意破坏
but I suspect it was sabotage by the competition,

547
00:20:45,580 --> 00:20:47,790
很有可能是"衣柜衣柜衣柜衣柜"公司
maybe Closets, Closets, Closets, Closets.

548
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:50,770
还不错 有点肿 有点像你看完
Not too bad, a little puffy, kind of like your eyes were

549
00:20:50,770 --> 00:20:52,430
《海底总动员》之后哭红的双眼 米勒
when you saw "Finding Nemo," Miller.

550
00:21:23,780 --> 00:21:29,460
我不是说了吗 要有乐观的心态
Like I said -- positive attitude.
